       <h1>Anil Kapoor Nominated for Best Actor at Asian Academy Creative Awards for Subedaar</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Anil Kapoor</span> <span>#Subedaar</span> <span>#Asian Academy Creative Awards</span> <span>#Bollywood</span></div>
       <p>Anil Kapoor has secured a nomination in the Best Actor in a Leading Role category at the Asian Academy Creative Awards for his performance in Suresh Triveni’s action-drama *Subedaar*. In the film, Kapoor portrays retired soldier Subedaar Arjun Maurya. Director Suresh Triveni also received a nomination for Best Direction (Feature Film) for *Subedaar*.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/anil-kapoor-nominated-for-best-actor-at-asian-academy-creati.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Kapoor shared his appreciation on social media, describing the recognition as &quot;A very special moment in my journey.&quot; He expressed honor at the nomination and for representing India, extending gratitude to the entire team and supporters. He specifically acknowledged Triveni, stating, &quot;@sureshtriveni_, this one means even more to me because of the journey we shared making it.&quot;</p><p>This nomination further enhances the international recognition for *Subedaar*, a film that depicts a retired soldier's adjustment to civilian life, blending action with emotional depth. Kapoor, with a career spanning over four decades in Hindi cinema, including roles in *Mr. India*, *Nayak*, and international projects like *Slumdog Millionaire*, continues to receive accolades for his diverse performances.</p><p>What to watch: *Subedaar* for its critically acclaimed performances and direction.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is accurate and captures all key details from the source, including the nomination, the specific film, and the actor's reaction.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/anil-kapoor-nominated-for-best-actor-at-asian-academy-creative-awards-for-subedaar-a-very-special-moment-in-my-journey/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
