       <h1>Dupahiya Season 2 explores exam fraud and village chaos</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Directed by Sonam Nair, the second season of the web series Dupahiya returns to the village of Dhadakpur, focusing on the Jha family's desperate search for money. The plot follows Roshni, who attempts to cheat on her SSC exams through a racket run by Pratham Kumar, while her father Banwari faces local backlash over plans to install a 5G tower.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/dupahiya-season-2-explores-exam-fraud-and-village-chaos.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Starring Gajraj Rao, Shivani Raghuvanshi, and Dinesh Lal Yadav, the series incorporates topical themes of paper leaks and exam fraud. Screenwriters Chirag Garg and Avinash Dwivedi utilize quirky humour and gags to drive the narrative as police officer Mithilesh Kushwaha investigates the criminal activity.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article provides a concise and accurate summary of the series plot, cast, and themes based on the provided review.</p>
