      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/keralam-to-enact-law-to-provide-legal-guarantees-to-elderly-chief-minister-vd-satheesan/article71532573.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
