      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/wrestling/desh-ka-tiranga-lehra-diya-nitesh-siwach-reacts-after-historic-greco-roman-silver-at-asian-games-2026-12126336#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
