     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-01 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Nivin Pauly Confirms 'Benz' Connection to Lokesh Kanagaraj Cinematic Universe</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Nivin Pauly has confirmed that his character, Walter, in the upcoming action film 'Benz' is integrated into the Lokesh Kanagaraj Cinematic Universe (LCU). Directed by Bakkiyaraj Kannan and starring Raghava Lawrence, the project features narrative links to established LCU figures such as Dilli and Rolex.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/nivin-pauly-confirms-benz-connection-to-lokesh-kanagaraj-cin.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Meanwhile, Pauly’s recent release, 'Bethlehem Kudumba Unit,' has achieved positive box office results. The film is currently scheduled to debut on OTT streaming platforms on October 2. These developments highlight the continued expansion of the LCU franchise and the actor's recent professional successes in both cinema and digital distribution.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is concise, accurate, and includes all relevant details from the source summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/malayalam/movies/news/nivin-pauly-on-whether-benz-is-connected-to-lcu-says-im-a-big-fan-of-dilli-and-rolex/articleshow/134606876.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
