       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-01 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Radhikka Madan Discusses Sailee Role and Female Representation in Lust Stories 3</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Radhikka Madan plays the flawed and emotionally complex character Sailee in Netflix’s anthology Lust Stories 3, directed by Shakun Batra. In a recent interview, Madan criticized the societal tendency to unfairly blame women for failed relationships, noting that women are often viewed as responsible for domestic stability.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/radhikka-madan-discusses-sailee-role-and-female-representati.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>She praised the anthology for its authentic portrayal of female desire, contrasting it with industry roles that treat women as mere objects or furniture. Madan also shared that her father supported her acting career despite her mother’s initial concerns regarding negative industry reports, and she expressed appreciation for her co-star Ali Fazal.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately captures the essence of the source material and includes all key points, including the personal anecdote about her parents and her professional philosophy.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
