       <h1>Shillong Teer Results for October 1, 2026</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Shillong Teer archery-based lottery results for October 1, 2026, are being released throughout the day. Participants can check winning numbers for the Shillong, Juwai, and Khanapara Teer games, which follow two-round formats based on arrow counts. Morning results for Shillong are already available, with the first round at 08 and the second at 30.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/shillong-teer-results-for-october-1-2026.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Other scheduled draws, including the main Shillong Teer, will conclude by late afternoon. Organised under Meghalaya local regulations, the game requires participants to predict numbers between 00 and 99. Players are advised to verify all winning figures through official channels before claiming prizes due to associated financial risks.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article effectively summarizes the context, date, and game mechanics, accurately reflecting the provided source text.</p>
