     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-10-01 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Top Run-Getters in South Africa-Australia 2026 ODI Series</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#cricket</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>South Africa secured a 2-1 victory over Australia in their three-match 2026 ODI series. Australian captain Mitchell Marsh topped the run-scoring charts, accumulating 200 runs across three innings at a strike rate of 152.67. South African batter Matthew Breetzke followed in second place with 171 runs, including a century in the opening match at Durban.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/top-run-getters-in-south-africa-australia-2026-odi-series.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>David Miller ranked third with 151 runs, highlighted by a career-best 142 off 93 balls in the second ODI at Johannesburg. While South Africa dominated the first two games, Australia claimed a consolation win in the rain-affected third match in Potchefstroom via the DLS method. Keshav Maharaj was named Player of the Series.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is accurate and captures the core statistics and narrative of the series well.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-appeal/top-3-run-getters-in-south-africa-vs-australia-odi-series-2026-4305/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
