     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · ESPN Cricinfo · 2026-10-01 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Wanderers to Stage 2027 ODI World Cup Final and India vs Pakistan Showdown</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#ODI World Cup</span> <span>#ICC</span> <span>#Sports</span></div>
       <p>The hallowed turf of Wanderers Stadium in Johannesburg has been officially designated as the venue for the 2027 ICC Men's ODI World Cup final. This significant announcement also confirms that the South African stadium will host one of cricket's most electrifying encounters: the highly anticipated clash between fierce rivals India and Pakistan.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/wanderers-to-stage-2027-odi-world-cup-final-and-india-vs-pak.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The global spectacle is slated to begin its main round on October 7, with Newlands in Cape Town hosting the inaugural match. The tournament's intense schedule will unfold over six weeks, culminating in the championship decider on November 21. Reigning champions Australia, having claimed the previous title, will undoubtedly be looking to defend their crown against a strong international field.</p><p>These comprehensive fixture details for the ICC Men's #CWC27 were unveiled by the International Cricket Council on October 1, 2026. Fans eager to experience the action firsthand can now find information regarding the ticket ballot, a crucial step for securing attendance at this premier cricketing event.</p><p>What to watch: The complete fixture list promises a thrilling array of matches and destinations for cricket enthusiasts.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.cricinfo.com/ci/content/story/1556110.html?ex_cid=OTC-RSS" rel="noopener">ESPN Cricinfo</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
