       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-01 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Yami Gautam's Nayyi Navelli Trailer Launched in Mumbai</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Yami Gautam, Adinath Kothare, Sushmita Mukherjee, Mita Vashisht, producers Nikhil Madhok, Aanand L Rai, and Himanshu Sharma, along with director Balaji Mohan, attended the Mumbai trailer launch of the film Nayyi Navelli. This event served as Yami Gautam’s first major public appearance following her National Award win.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-01/yami-gautams-nayyi-navelli-trailer-launched-in-mumbai.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>During the proceedings, Sushmita Mukherjee complimented Yami Gautam, noting that her long arms resemble those of Lord Rama and are considered a sign of good luck. The production team organized the launch at a local multiplex to celebrate the upcoming project.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately summarizes the provided text without adding external information.</p>
